[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "I'll never forget."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "That night, for the first time"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "in 120 years,"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "snow fell on Santa Destroy."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "It was a sign..."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Another change,"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "both beautiful and deadly,"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "was coming... "
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "It's called fashionably late,"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "fuck face."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Travis Touchdown,  "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "This place bring back any memories? "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "It's only where my last killing"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "spree started."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "All those screwed up ranking fights.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "Now why would I remember that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "It'll be your blood this time "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "when I avenge my brother!  "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Draw!"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Brother?"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Who?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "Don't you remember the man"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "you fought here?"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "Umm... No,"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "can't say I do."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Guess he didn't make an impression."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Musta been crazy weak."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "You insensitive prick!"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "You killed him and you don't even remember!"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "You know how humiliating that is?"
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Sorry,"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "I don't keep a death diary."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "And in case you're wondering,"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "I'm even stronger now."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "You will lose."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "You've got no chance of winning this."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "You're something else."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "I haven't been so worked up in ages! "
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "When you see your bro in Hell,"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "tell him he's "
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "STILL... A... DOUCHE!"
  }
]